  "change": "Let the HTML rendering task own the animation clock for a document attached to the BrowserApp page and its actual local root navigable. Native drawing no longer samples the same timelines again. Standalone or mismatched page/root documents keep native sampling; all paths retain future display wakes. Original native tick remains an opt-in control; separate once-only diagnostics verify the selected path.",
